{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:07ccd2db488e954cf9c8b18d5da9a00c751dcefbd673381811a53683167bf148",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f695ebdff3ce63cb2cc9efc2184cbb8f47e3d57c6b0304a08f7ca5c188c54706",
      "text": "秘密的生日大作战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f9d8a5b5d6878ed91258f8edd82201b4ec42733d1828e2616531e2f0d4f287",
      "text": "直央的生日快到了。\n花音和志狼拉上制作人，\n开始了“生日大作战”。\n生日当天，毫不知情的直央在事务所里\n发现的东西是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000016:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000016:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f695ebdff3ce63cb2cc9efc2184cbb8f47e3d57c6b0304a08f7ca5c188c54706",
      "text": "秘密的生日大作战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d6b8605cb55fa1d5c618f1b911a61291bf1202a5892ada3c2125ea41633f9fc",
      "text": "马上就是直央君的生日了呢。\n今年要怎么办呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ea8b37ff26b62ad2b8a2b5d68d0c5133f1ad14a3f559819f90aa435664d3fa6",
      "text": "嗯啊？怎么办是啥意思？\n啊，是要办生日会的意思啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:668cfd1dd53fe55a5779daa527f271e75e7cc43b9434234e805a4da1176e0b40",
      "text": "那是当然的啦！大家给花音办了生日派对，\n花音超级开心的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb98908fd7e8c5ba8001886346c385977d262e524410da9f17a17b52d6ef365",
      "text": "所以，我也想让直央君开心呀。\n当然，志狼君的生日会也是要办的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b92fa41cf65c28a6ec1b3965e946a3b31d2791660305bdf862c2d58d0c1ac1e",
      "text": "哎呀，我才不会因为生日派对这种小事\n一喜……一悠？什么的大惊小怪呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33876c107bb40a1dcca856d93d0013798e19028b0e473b17523705355b45b1df",
      "text": "啊，制作人！来得正好。\n那个呢，我有件事想找你商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e233a5febf36732610d0ccea7ab8d443ffd009016779ac87e3d617b8ee2c2382",
      "text": "好啊。\n难不成，是关于直央君生日的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:172b1c90ec59de4a7f5a68ebec8df432bd99bdd24675fbf47cb8106b43a0a27d",
      "text": "对对，真不愧是制作人♪\n我们想要给直央君庆祝生日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67c612f5bd96f574e8b645414cc767558efb2bdceeaac6faa910e088c82a531d",
      "text": "可是，那家伙遇到啥会高兴啊？\n果然还是送礼物啥的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:174bbabe4851a6f5540dffbe4fd68b83362631ed8b080b5c57b47d9f593bbf4a",
      "text": "还有时间，大家一起慢慢想吧。\n要是能办成一场很棒的生日会就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:310e0777f447e84df5ae4d2da20c8d339f9b78f234f2d2ad4c51aaf09b96b8a2",
      "text": "哇——赞成～！直央君的\n秘密“生日大作战”，启动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b178fe4da9c4a8173e54a6400982f4873c723557ad0695132f52e9fb8e8070c",
      "text": "辛苦大家了。明天放假。\n大家请好好休息哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50fb0e4a710dabf84cd5b8287e517db085737a79b62a7fe2091377749aa4b23f",
      "text": "好——！\n花音明天要和妈妈一起烤饼干♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58346f1c3ae02bbaf71d4a9e8dde21dc67c653807bb8398c51c74659d8c38129",
      "text": "我要跟老哥一起打篮球——！\n超——期待的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:640c356b74a16d1cad51f220124a3eb8154d2d725cc8d68a28e14780d00ed06d",
      "text": "这样啊。你们两个玩得开心点哦。\n那么，我今天就先回去了。大家辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84cbad757ce2c3fd025ae2bdbd48f8abdc5a7ed64afb577db413f9f6359d60f1",
      "text": "辛苦啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:412b2967b8951c42b62d0831cda80c7afb2e9060d2998deffae76709e7fed948",
      "text": "……没露馅吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3b3d3773c8eae850b588af863e5d38023a6c70a21fce856792283e72da7deb5",
      "text": "没露馅呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:905687ede6ed6fe9aafc42f564b21228a27d1ed406d3c95fa01201bd491aecd2",
      "text": "好嘞！\n按计划，明天就来准备直央的生日会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fc1a29485da7bb6f4107a76095773083dd46100d162c34fb3541739a36b8efb",
      "text": "嗯。明明是休息日，\n还能和制作人在一起，好开心呀～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8693690e101d2d52bc707b75985f4a95d80a5817bebd0009ab3c4d680025b66",
      "text": "好，明天就拜托两位了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec0b81460a4bb3631d2479e8a1e84c1b04ba48cb8b6b467e8ebe59247bba4aed",
      "text": "那么志狼君、制作人。\n生日大作战，第2阶段，启动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048",
      "text": "噢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b50b5752d056b7db6cb8c7c4c6cb62c3e4f21ec2d24c772d1fb63e070747175",
      "text": "（难道还没人来事务所吗？\n今天明明是约好在这里集合的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc782307eae59cab41c679b29e1f2dc58ebabcc8552b428d8bb04064f5009e5e",
      "text": "（制作人好像也不在。\n今天是在忙其他工作吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff156b8eb3b6f39a86d828521cdadf9606de21b759d95c126d4e5b20b1473d5d",
      "text": "咦？放着一封信。\n是谁落在这里的吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dc6ba5fc7a2caa0a086917efa1d0fc852bb760af39f69f086d58b937d183afa",
      "text": "“致冈村直央君”……这是花音君的字？\n用的是小兔子的信封，肯定是了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87856a20029bbb89c358a69ec483072673f949ddd6f1b7625b182f92c09a827b",
      "text": "“看看走廊楼梯的扶手”\n走廊的楼梯？会有什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eed05479e74c7bd65efce19ef44d8631ee283c4f35477561abb0171cf852075",
      "text": "扶手、扶手……啊，找到了！\n这次是狼图案的信封？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65507c617d9b192ae3588c92ae4a2c3e9a4e9409736d6d354e1e396fed638add",
      "text": "“前往4楼的休息室！”\n……呵呵，这是志狼君的字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33ec6cc15d2de4c9a317b3c977269ca5e7a8a329fbc6047015b2dd6018df7eed",
      "text": "这到底是怎么回事……？\n去看看就明白了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dac232795985b46208d0b282fe7d7833a858d4f51b34af33cf127ad00888a4b6",
      "text": "花音君、志狼君，你们在这里吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b9f4078b3886020df2f0a146ea51a4a12fec2453995ff3402455ef5c6d06b6a",
      "text": "直央，生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc2622216a0092b6bbe424cffa95eaa93469f2af7c4fc0fd30fc70ae943e4501",
      "text": "哇啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4d30ee121f228a3ccfe57eae9e37f920ec49e2c7b946a12b9ff772beb8b3620",
      "text": "吓、吓了一跳。花音君、志狼君，\n连制作人也在……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb19bee7a84f3b3e21128bd04509dc27225135e496d65e55a376a16115cb73d4",
      "text": "啊哈哈，太棒啦。作战大成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14b7de2bf2bd8e74015329c9369714810caef9229fe0cb659721c6437a28a716",
      "text": "作战其一，“不被直央君发现偷偷办生日会”\n首先成功了太好啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:355dc1a828c182bb9b4413a839198cc3136e4a195fce6021551d41d2f9fe46b7",
      "text": "这算是“其一”的话，\n难道还有其他的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9b72cb2104444e6a1ee251bf3caa9b40a839a839b7d6565edad2533b45dc4ad",
      "text": "作战其二就是这个！直央肯定会喜欢的东西。\n大家一起挑选的礼物哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d51d36229192e8b63d5ab16bde3fe341c7db30bd01c26b2ed1ef675c8f3b1f",
      "text": "哇，好开心啊。谢谢你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3538a88fbf546c1d403fec1dd375255e90508a4625236a9ded6dca8a709c2778",
      "text": "作战其二也是大成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:195869db56203dc200451bc98956a1010e50856b1695d38f747359e3f7367fb5",
      "text": "太好啦，志狼君♪\n制作人，那个也拜托了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_d:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b668bcf1c303d89370327fafe03da0abb16fed67c2ba7a623b6c8e3c9a22f5e",
      "text": "好，这里还有蛋糕哦。\n大家一起吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b203e679398cdbff0ce921bc3725f7e8fafc530d1007cb9d20a5f516017325a1",
      "text": "最后是“作战其三”。\n大家一起来做直央君喜欢的事吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4a50a24199fe3953d83b7fab9697d94a745b3a0a6a78c8042f823926f830035",
      "text": "啊！那个难道是……将棋套装？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38df1ff8b6bdd74f17d9740fc2b6680c599679aa5508b2a21beed433a0b367d2",
      "text": "直央君不是很喜欢将棋嘛。\n我们也想一起玩。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11c3d48f82adf2f948bcdedd68b6c869cef389397dc800ab76a41996120316da",
      "text": "可是，平时见到的那个对局，\n不是只能两个人下嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f4a6aa7b2754d00b63fa439b3d070ea7ce2c27dfeb8d6276292f15a2b921a0",
      "text": "所以，我们就去直央君常去的将棋俱乐部问了问，\n有没有大家能一起玩的玩法哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cd38aa14b7bc6653ba5ce28748f180df8263367936f44ca598e83ceda206362",
      "text": "那是我常去的地方……\n是花音君你们亲自去打听的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:124562b37866f467a0f28550cba5dbead1ecaab37844890f9ac2ad74d56d21b1",
      "text": "嗯，制作人带我们去的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba80f54daea5f99b6cebe1fe30ebbfbe912a28717e35c8d879aeccbf67b94323",
      "text": "他们教了我们一种叫\n“旋转将棋”的玩法哦～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96c90242847653ca1a930d685938f0c7ce001967ce49dcfd7f95ad8cfd511257",
      "text": "对啊，就是像大富翁一样的那种。\n这样所有人就能一起玩了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd1014974b7000ab2b5cd9872356bafccd3225ca31fdb202c91c3a1d62a65ce",
      "text": "你们两个……谢谢你们，我真的好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36716d2380227e74ae922f70dd611d352e7721ad392361e14ffd1b4218453891",
      "text": "没想到你们竟然会想要\n陪我一起玩我喜欢的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57fdb18a918ea3c5cad2487b7a6cce1791dd5da17013d1a8c2311b3b43f073aa",
      "text": "作战其三也大成功！赶紧来玩吧♪\n直央君、志狼君，制作人也一起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000164:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8ba5f63568d1a2ab1f0cbe6fd89097aadb0c318b65cba044ff7567676625767",
      "text": "之后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4c403c724b8b6a38fc5ebdba566ee3cd98b066e8b030e901176233edc3d504d",
      "text": "呃，已经到回家的时间了！？\n我还想玩到赢为止呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a5f62a674af2a8e539206a738b0c9aa89d39935279806f2246eeab5e1ad2eb9",
      "text": "直央君旋转将棋也下得好厉害呢！\n花音和志狼君完全追不上～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e7a98d41def27ade26ff3c74056429d28aeb1603b61b2df0261cbaf23746fd8",
      "text": "啊哈哈……这次只是运气好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_e:cmd-000209:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cec7f75839d882fbc44596959af7b1522ed99a03870155ec1b819cc9b2b68a2",
      "text": "花音君、志狼君、制作人。\n再次为生日会由衷地感谢大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
